 ing as a duo\, or an artist collective\, get a fully funded two-month resi
 dency at CERN in summer 2027\, with a tailored programme of dialogue with.
 ..\n\nOrganisation: Arts at CERN\, with the City of Geneva and the Republi
 c and Canton of Geneva\nLocation: CERN\, Geneva\, Switzerland. Only for ar
 tists domiciled in the Canton of Geneva (collectives: registered office in
  the canton)\, applying as a duo or collective\, aged 18+.\nAward: CHF 30\
 ,000 grant for research\, development and production\, plus a monthly stip
 end of CHF 5\,000 per artist for a duo or CHF 10\,000 per month for a coll
 ective\, for two months\; curatorial mentoring. No application fee stated.
 \nDuration: Two months on site\, Monday to Friday\, summer 2027 (June to J
 uly).\n\nMore: https://arts.cern/call/grand-prix-resonance/?utm_source=art
