 r 12 weeks on focused research and experiments in space\, grounded in the 
 building's context and history\, and closes with a public event of their c
 hoice (exhibition\, screening\, performance\, workshop\, open studio).\n\n
 Organisation: Flora Filmtheater\, funded by Café Restaurant Flora\nLocati
 on: The Hague\, Netherlands (former KPN telephone exchange building). Only
  for artists living in The Hague.\nAward: Artist fee of EUR 1\,500 per mon
 th plus a material/production budget of EUR 1\,000. Collectives and duos s
 hare the same budget. No accommodation. No application fee stated.\nDurati
 on: 12 weeks. Spring: 15 February to 9 May 2027. Summer: 14 June to 5 Sept
 ember 2027.\n\nMore: https://www.florafilmtheater.nl/flora-air?utm_source=
 artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.florafilmtheater.nl/flora-air?utm_source=artificialnouveaug
 rantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:The Hague\, Netherlands (former KPN telephone exchange building). 
 Only for artists living in The Hague.
