 UR 2\,450)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 30 Dec 2026 at 23:00 CET.\n\nAIR InSILo is an artist-run
  residency in Hollabrunn\, a small town north of Vienna. Its 2027 round is
  curated by Ahmad Darkhabani\, an architect\, curator and researcher from 
 Damascus based in Graz\, under the theme "when the hourless seeps". THEME:
  the fragility of reality and life\, and the structures that build and sta
 bilise our understanding of them.\n\nOrganisation: AIR InSILo\nLocation: H
 ollabrunn\, Lower Austria\, Austria (about 50 km north of Vienna). In resi
 dence\; residents must be present for at least 80% of the time. No nationa
