SUMMARY:Deadline 17:00 CET: Collegium Helveticum: Early-Career Fellowships 
 2027-2028 (ten months in Zurich\, about CHF 75\,000 to 85\,000\; academic 
 and artistic disciplines)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 11 Feb 2027 at 17:00 CET.\n\nThe Collegium Helveticum is
  the institute for advanced studies run jointly by ETH Zurich\, the Univer
 sity of Zurich and the Zurich University of the Arts. Its Early-Career Fel
 lowships bring researchers and artists to Zurich for ten months to pursue 
 a project that cuts across disciplinary boundaries\, from blue-sky researc
 h to applied science and from fine arts to artistic research.\n\nOrganisat
 ion: Collegium Helveticum (joint institute for advanced studies of ETH Zur
 ich\, the University of Zurich and the Zurich University of the Arts)\nLoc
 ation: Zurich\, Switzerland (in residence\; full-time employment as a post
 doctoral researcher at ETH Zurich)\nAward: Stipend based on ETH Zurich pos
 tdoctoral pay rates\, currently about CHF 75\,000 to CHF 85\,000 in total 
 for the ten months\, paid monthly. Up to CHF 2\,000 for travel and researc
 h expenses\, plus a budget of up to CHF 8\,000 for an interdisciplinary ev
 ent organised by the fellow.\nDuration: Ten months\, 1 September 2027 to 3
 0 June 2028\n\nMore: https://collegium.ethz.ch/fellowships/early-career-fe
 llowship?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://collegium.ethz.ch/fellowships/early-career-fellowship?utm_sourc
 e=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Zurich\, Switzerland (in residence\; full-time employment as a pos
 tdoctoral researcher at ETH Zurich)
END:VEVENT
