  Teatro das Figuras in Faro to co-produce one new work of art and technolo
 gy with a performative or hybrid (performance and installation) form.\n\nO
 rganisation: gnration (Braga) and Teatro das Figuras (Faro)\nLocation: Bra
 ga and Faro\, Portugal. No nationality or residence restriction stated\; a
 pplications in Portuguese or English.\nAward: EUR 10\,000 in financial sup
 port for the whole project\, plus VAT if applicable. This is an all-in bud
 get covering fees\, team travel and set transport\, accommodation\, meals\
 , production and materials. Also includes a creation residency at gnration
 \, a technical residency at Teatro das Figuras and two public presentation
 s with technical support. No application fee stated.\nDuration: 9-day crea
 tion residency in Braga (31 May to 8 June 2027)\, 3-day technical residenc
 y in Faro (17 to 19 January 2028)\, presentations on 9 October 2027 and 20
  January 2028\n\nMore: https://www.gnration.pt/event/2026/binario-opencall
 /?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
