 nning makers\, who work for two weeks in Middelburg with a local mentor an
 d then show the result. WHO: artists and designers who graduated recently.
  Interest in Zeeland matters\, and the call says the tie to the province m
 ay be read broadly\; the page does not set a nationality or residence rule
 \, and the call text is in Dutch.\n\nOrganisation: CBK Zeeland\nLocation: 
 Middelburg\, Zeeland\, Netherlands. For recently graduated artists and des
 igners with an interest in or tie to Zeeland (interpreted broadly).\nAward
 : Fee of EUR 3\,000 (per the Dutch artist fee guideline\, richtlijn kunste
 naarshonoraria) plus a work budget of EUR 500\, with a local mentor and a 
 closing exhibition. No application fee stated.\nDuration: 2-week work peri
 od (1 to 17 February 2027)\, exhibition opening 18 February 2027\n\nMore: 
